    <briefdescription>
<para>Canopy wind speed profile calculations. </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>This module contains routines for calculating wind speed profiles within and above forest canopies using Monin-Obukhov Similarity Theory (MOST) and in-canopy parameterizations based on Massman et al. (2017). <simplesect kind="author"><para>P. C. Campbell </para>
</simplesect>
<simplesect kind="date"><para>06/22 (Prototype) </para>
</simplesect>
</para>
